02	Display.Conversation	Bert	It laughed? At the Sword of Valour? ...Oh. Oh, I should have seen it coming.\Every Shard the Hand slips it through the barrier, it wears. They cling to it like iron filings to a lodestone, and I don't like to think why.\And the sword's been asleep since the first king laid it down. It was made in three fires, heir, and it wants waking in them, in their order.	Where are they?	03
